\fs36 \cf0 Goal\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Phase 1 finds interesting apps.\
Phase 2 investigates whether there is a real opportunity.\
Phase 3 determines whether it could potentially be a viable business.\
Phase 4 determines:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 What should we build instead?
\f1\b0 \
Phase 5 asks:\

\f0\b Can we build a basic version of it that validates the idea?
\f1\b0 \
The goal is to autonomously build a 
\f0\b very small Proof of Concept
\f1\b0 .\
This is 
\f0\b not
\f1\b0  the full application.\
This is 
\f0\b not
\f1\b0  production software.\
This phase should build only enough of the product to demonstrate the core idea.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

