\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 Step 3: Reduce the Product to a Tiny POC\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 This is the most important step.\
Ask:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 What is the smallest possible application that demonstrates the core idea?
\f1\b0 \
The Autonomous Builder should actively remove features.\
Example:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 \
PRODUCT DESIGN\
\
Must-have features:\
\
- Create fishing trip\
- Record catch\
- Add location\
- Add photo\
- Track species\
- View statistics\
- Search history\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 Phase 5 might reduce this to:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 \
POC\
\
- Create trip\
- Add catch\
- View catches\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 No:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 \
GPS\
\
Photos\
\
Cloud synchronization\
\
Accounts\
\
Statistics\
\
Search\
\
Payments\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 Unless they are absolutely necessary to demonstrate the idea.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 POC Rule\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The POC should answer:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 Does the core application concept work?
\f1\b0 \
It should not answer:\

\f0\b Is the application complete?
\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 Step 4: Create a Simple Build Plan\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Before building, generate a very small plan.\
Example:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 \
1. Create application.\
\
2. Create simple local data storage.\
\
3. Create screen to add fishing trip.\
\
4. Create screen to add catch.\
\
5. Create screen to view catches.\
\
6. Test workflow.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 Do not create:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 \

\f4 \uc0\u10060 
\f2  100-step development plan\
\

\f4 \uc0\u10060 
\f2  Enterprise architecture document\
\

\f4 \uc0\u10060 
\f2  Complete technical specification\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 The plan should be short.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 Step 5: Choose the Simplest Technology\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The system should choose the easiest reasonable technology for the POC.\
The goal is:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 \
FAST\
+\
SIMPLE\
+\
WORKING\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 Not:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 \
PERFECT\
+\
SCALABLE\
+\
ENTERPRISE READY\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 For example:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 \
Web App\
\
Python + simple frontend\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 Or:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 \
Mobile App\
\
React Native / Expo\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 Or another simple technology appropriate for the product.\
