\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 This part will likely require further design later.\
For now, the general concept is:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 \
PRODUCT DESIGN\
        
\f3 \uc0\u8595 
\f2 \
BUILD INSTRUCTIONS\
        
\f3 \uc0\u8595 
\f2 \
