\f3 \uc0\u8595 
\f2 \
RUN APPLICATION\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 The Autonomous Builder should use an agentic coding system to build the POC.\
Possible future options could include:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 \
Roo Code\
\
Codex\
\
OpenCode\
\
Claude Code\
\
Local Ollama coding agent\
\
Custom agent harness\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs24 \cf0 The specific coding system does not need to be decided yet.
\f1\b0 \
Phase 5 should be designed so the builder can eventually use whichever coding agent you decide works best.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 Builder Responsibilities\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The coding system should:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 \
