\
Write code\
\
Run application\
\
Check for errors\
\
Fix obvious errors\
\
Run again\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 The goal is to reach:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

