\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 Step 8: Fix Obvious Problems\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 If the application fails:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 \
APPLICATION DOES NOT START\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 Fix it.\
If:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 \
CORE WORKFLOW DOES NOT WORK\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 Fix it.\
Do not enter an endless development cycle.\
The system should have limits.\
Example:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 \
Maximum build attempts: 3\
\
Maximum fix attempts: 5\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 These values can be configuration options.\
