\f2\fs26 \cf0 \
BUILD_FAILED\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 Save the result.\
Do not endlessly attempt to fix it.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
